{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728</i> in this exclusive <strong>demo version</strong>, where you get a first taste of your journey as a rebellious wizard and the new director of a magical academy. Challenge the Ministry of Magic, begin rebuilding the ancient castle, and explore the first secrets hidden within its enchanted halls. Will you start laying the foundations for a new era of magic, or will Minister Cassandra tighten her grip on your ambitions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536880/extras/gif1.2-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1747937471\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What Awaits You in the Demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A First Look at Your Magical Academy</strong> \u2013 Begin restoring the castle, make initial decisions, and get a glimpse of the challenges that await as headmaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intriguing Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover some of the castle\u2019s hidden secrets and witness the first layers of its deep mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face the Ministry\u2019s Influence</strong> \u2013 Get your first taste of the political tension and rebellion against the cunning Minister Cassandra.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adult Content Teaser</strong> \u2013 Experience early interactions with captivating characters, setting the tone for the seductive and bold moments that await in the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Basics of Magic</strong> \u2013 Experiment with early spells and magical mechanics that will evolve as your power grows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>demo version</strong> offers just a glimpse of the grand adventure ahead. Are you ready to take your first steps toward reshaping the world of magic?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536880?t=1747937471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536880?t=1747937471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536880/3a4c030c7de9d7f891eda742e4d11037dc67bac5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747937471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536880/3a4c030c7de9d7f891eda742e4d11037dc67bac5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747937471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or suitable for viewing at work, including sexual content, nudity. All characters in the game are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728</i> in this exclusive <strong>demo version</strong>, where you get a first taste of your journey as a rebellious wizard and the new director of a magical academy. Challenge the Ministry of Magic, begin rebuilding the ancient castle, and explore the first secrets hidden within its enchanted halls. Will you start laying the foundations for a new era of magic, or will Minister Cassandra tighten her grip on your ambitions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536880/extras/gif1.2-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1747937471\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What Awaits You in the Demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A First Look at Your Magical Academy</strong> \u2013 Begin restoring the castle, make initial decisions, and get a glimpse of the challenges that await as headmaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intriguing Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover some of the castle\u2019s hidden secrets and witness the first layers of its deep mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face the Ministry\u2019s Influence</strong> \u2013 Get your first taste of the political tension and rebellion against the cunning Minister Cassandra.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adult Content Teaser</strong> \u2013 Experience early interactions with captivating characters, setting the tone for the seductive and bold moments that await in the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Basics of Magic</strong> \u2013 Experiment with early spells and magical mechanics that will evolve as your power grows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>demo version</strong> offers just a glimpse of the grand adventure ahead. Are you ready to take your first steps toward reshaping the world of magic?</p>","developers":["Taboo Tales \ud83d\udc98"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3424900","name":"LUST & MAGIC \u2728"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536880/header.jpg?t=1747937471","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257138491,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138491/movie480.mp4?t=1747859667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138491/movie_max.mp4?t=1747859667"},"name":"LUST & MAGIC \u2728","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138491/0ef3f1c486f0ec69d595d3249c78fded714933fb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747859667","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138491/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747859667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138491/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747859667"}}],"name":"LUST & MAGIC \u2728 Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minim